<view class="page">
  <view class="head">
    <text class="title">麦克风校准</text>
  </view>
  <view class="section--advanced">
    <text> 
      以经验为基准的简易麦克风偏移量校准：<br/>
      本地麦克风设备校准偏移量<br/>
      -67dbFS ~ 10dbSPL 非常安静的房间<br/>
      -35dbFS ~ 60dbSPL 1m 正常谈话<br/>
      10 - (-67) = 77<br/>
    </text>
    <view class="noise-level">
      当前实时分贝：{{dbfs}} (dB FS)
    </view>
    <view class="noise-level">
      当前实时分贝：{{dbspl}} (dB SPL)
    </view>
  </view>
  <div class="canvas-container">
    <canvas id="canvas-back" type="2d" style="width: 623rpx; height: 602rpx;" />
    <canvas id="canvas-front" type="2d" style="width: 623rpx; height: 602rpx;" />
  </div>
  <view class="footer">
    <button class="btn btn--primary" bindtap="stopNoiseMonitoring" style="position: relative; left: -16rpx; top: 627rpx; width: 308rpx; box-sizing: border-box">退出校准</button>
  </view>  
</view>


